{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given an array of **distinct** integers `arr`, find the minimum absolute difference between any two elements, and return **every pair** `[a, b]` with that difference, with `a < b`, in ascending order of `a`."
    },
